{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117777","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117777/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117777/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117777/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117777","id":4124728405,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc712lxV","number":117777,"title":"Suffix -noimp does not work for importing animations","user":{"login":"ummkris","id":124468609,"node_id":"U_kgDOB2s9gQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124468609?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris","html_url":"https://github.com/ummkris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ummkris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-03-24T01:58:15Z","updated_at":"2026-03-28T01:05:34Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.2, 4.14, 3.6.2 (official Linux executable)\n- Blender 5.0.1 Flatpak\n\n### System information\n\nFedora 43 KDE - Godot 4.6.1.stable - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis seems to be the case in all versions of Godot I tested, so maybe it's not a bug but rather a small issue with the documentation.\n\nAccording to the [Node type customization using name suffixes](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/assets_pipeline/importing_3d_scenes/node_type_customization.html#animation-loop-loop-cycle) page, the `-noimp` suffix removes both nodes and animations at import time. \n\nHowever, animations (exported as Actions or NLA tracks) including `-noimp` are still included (remaining in the animation name), while it works properly for 3D objects. The `-loop` suffix works as intended for animations.\n\n<img width=\"825\" height=\"194\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/be650a36-0be6-4fa5-9690-9e93a41924c5\" />\n\n<img width=\"449\" height=\"271\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1057b2f-b949-49f1-821a-ffd693b5931d\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open Blender, create two new Actions in the Action Editor\n2. Name one TestOne and the other TestTwo-noimp\n3. Export as a .GLB file\n4. Import into Godot\n\nBoth animations will be present.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[animation-noimp-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26198725/animation-noimp-bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117777/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117777/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}